# 🚦 Traffic Challan Automation System

An AI-powered **Traffic Challan Automation System** that detects traffic violations and vehicle number plates from images, extracts vehicle registration numbers using AI-based OCR, retrieves vehicle and violation details from MySQL, generates digital challans, and provides a WhatsApp Click-to-Chat notification option.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

The **Traffic Challan Automation System** automates the process of detecting traffic violations and generating challans.

The system takes a vehicle image as input and performs the following operations:

1. Detects the vehicle number plate using YOLO.
2. Detects traffic violations using a custom YOLO model.
3. Crops the detected number plate.
4. Extracts the vehicle registration number using Groq Vision OCR.
5. Searches the vehicle details in a MySQL database.
6. Identifies the detected violation.
7. Retrieves the applicable fine amount.
8. Generates a digital challan.
9. Stores the challan record in MySQL.
10. Provides a downloadable challan receipt.
11. Provides a WhatsApp Click-to-Chat option for challan notification.

---

# ✨ Features

## 🚗 Number Plate Detection

A custom-trained YOLO model is used to detect vehicle number plates from uploaded images.

The detected number plate is cropped and saved for further processing.

---

## 🚨 Traffic Violation Detection

A custom YOLO model is used to identify traffic violations.

The current application supports configured violations such as:

* No Helmet
* Using Mobile
* No Parking
* Triple Riding
* Overspeed

The available violations and fines depend on the records configured in the MySQL database.

---

## 🔍 AI-Based Number Plate OCR

The cropped number plate image is processed using a **Groq Vision model**.

The OCR prompt instructs the model to return only the vehicle registration number.

Example:

```text
TS09AB1234
```

This extracted registration number is then used to search the vehicle database.

---

## 🗄️ MySQL Database Integration

MySQL is used to store and retrieve vehicle and traffic challan information.

The system uses database functionality for:

* Vehicle owner details
* Vehicle registration numbers
* Vehicle types
* Mobile numbers
* Traffic violations
* Fine amounts
* Generated challan records

---

## 🧾 Automated Challan Generation

Once the vehicle and violation are identified, the application generates a digital challan.

The challan contains information such as:

* Challan ID
* Vehicle registration number
* Owner name
* Vehicle type
* Traffic violation
* Fine amount
* Date and time

---

## 📱 WhatsApp Notification

A separate application version, **`app1[whatsapp].py`**, contains the WhatsApp functionality integrated into the Streamlit UI.

The system uses **WhatsApp Click-to-Chat** to open WhatsApp with a pre-filled challan message.

The message can contain:

* Challan ID
* Vehicle number
* Owner name
* Violation
* Fine amount
* Date and time

The user can review the message and manually press **Send**.

> **Note:** This project does not use the WhatsApp Business Cloud API. The WhatsApp feature is implemented using Click-to-Chat for project demonstration purposes.

---

# 🖥️ Two Application Versions

This project intentionally contains two Streamlit application files.

### `app.py`

This is the **main Traffic Challan Automation application**.

It contains the core traffic challan workflow, including:

* Image upload
* Number plate detection
* Traffic violation detection
* OCR
* Vehicle database lookup
* Fine lookup
* Challan generation
* Receipt download
* Challan history
* System overview

### `app1[whatsapp].py`

This is a **separate UI version with WhatsApp functionality**.

It contains the WhatsApp integration in the user interface and is kept separately so that the WhatsApp-enabled version can be tested independently from the main application.

---

# 🏗️ System Architecture

```text
                       Vehicle Image
                            │
                            ▼
                  ┌──────────────────┐
                  │    Streamlit     │
                  │   User Interface │
                  └────────┬─────────┘
                           │
              ┌────────────┴────────────┐
              │                         │
              ▼                         ▼
    ┌──────────────────┐      ┌──────────────────┐
    │ Number Plate YOLO│      │ Violation YOLO   │
    │     Detection    │      │     Detection    │
    └────────┬─────────┘      └────────┬─────────┘
             │                         │
             ▼                         ▼
      Cropped Plate             Violation Class
             │                         │
             ▼                         ▼
    ┌──────────────────┐      ┌──────────────────┐
    │   Groq Vision    │      │   MySQL Violation│
    │       OCR        │      │     Database     │
    └────────┬─────────┘      └────────┬─────────┘
             │                         │
             ▼                         ▼
       Vehicle Number             Fine Amount
             │                         │
             └────────────┬────────────┘
                          │
                          ▼
                 ┌─────────────────┐
                 │  MySQL User DB  │
                 │ Owner & Vehicle │
                 │     Details     │
                 └────────┬────────┘
                          │
                          ▼
                 ┌─────────────────┐
                 │ Challan Record  │
                 │    Generation   │
                 └────────┬────────┘
                          │
                 ┌────────┴────────┐
                 ▼                 ▼
          Receipt Download   WhatsApp Message
```

