Vehicle Registration Number
      ↓
MySQL Vehicle Lookup
      ↓
Violation & Fine Lookup
      ↓
Challan Generation
      ↓
Save Challan Record
      ↓
Download Receipt
      ↓
WhatsApp Notification
```

