# 🎯 Project Objectives

The main objectives of this project are:

* Automate traffic violation detection.
* Detect vehicle number plates using computer vision.
* Extract vehicle registration numbers using AI-based OCR.
* Retrieve vehicle owner information automatically.
* Identify the applicable traffic fine.
* Generate digital challans.
* Store challan information in MySQL.
* Provide downloadable challan receipts.
* Provide WhatsApp-based challan notification.
* Reduce manual effort in traffic challan processing.

